{"seq":3,"slug":"time-space-average","title":"时间与空间平均","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/ergodic-theory/theorems/time-space-average","wordCount":1224,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"时间与空间平均\">时间与空间平均</h1><p><a href=\"birkhoff-theorem\">Birkhoff</a> 给了逐点收敛，<a href=\"von-neumann-mean\">von Neumann</a> 给了均方收敛，两条定理都在遍历系统里把时间平均推向同一个数——空间平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int f\\,d\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>。这一篇不引入新定理，而是退后一步把它们的意义讲透：「时间平均 = 空间平均」这条等式到底买到了什么、它如何回应玻尔兹曼的原始猜想、又在什么意义上仍未兑现物理学家最初的期待。它是基础与应用之间的概念桥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一条等式-两种收敛\">核心概念：一条等式，两种收敛</h2><p>把两大定理并排，能看清它们是从两个角度逼近同一目标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>时间平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_N f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>收敛到</th>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>出处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单条轨道随时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac1N\\sum_{n&lt;N} f(T^n x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int f\\,d\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>逐点 a.e.</td>\n<td><a href=\"birkhoff-theorem\">Birkhoff</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 函数整体</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int f\\,d\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>均方</td>\n<td><a href=\"von-neumann-mean\">von Neumann</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>非遍历时，两者都仍收敛，但极限不是常数，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 关于不变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数的条件期望——直观说，系统先按<a href=\"../foundations/ergodicity-definition\">遍历分解</a>裂成若干遍历分量，每条轨道困在自己的分量里，时间平均只等于<strong>该分量内部</strong>的空间平均。遍历性恰好消灭所有分量、把系统粘成一整块，等式才在全空间上以单一常数成立。这就是为什么遍历性是「两种平均合一」的精确充要条件，不多不少。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[可观测量 f] --&gt; B[时间平均 沿轨道]&#10;  A --&gt; C[空间平均 按 mu]&#10;  B --&gt; D{系统遍历?}&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[两者相等&lt;br/&gt;= 单一常数 积分 f dmu]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[时间平均 = 所在遍历分量内的空间平均&lt;br/&gt;= 条件期望 E f given I]\">flowchart TD\n  A[可观测量 f] --&gt; B[时间平均 沿轨道]\n  A --&gt; C[空间平均 按 mu]\n  B --&gt; D{系统遍历?}\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|是| E[两者相等&lt;br/&gt;= 单一常数 积分 f dmu]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[时间平均 = 所在遍历分量内的空间平均&lt;br/&gt;= 条件期望 E f given I]</pre><h2 id=\"它到底买到了什么\">它到底买到了什么</h2><p>这条等式的实用价值，是把一个「难算的积分」换成「易跑的模拟」，或反过来把「易算的期望」当作「长期行为的预言」。三个层面值得分清：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可计算性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int f\\,d\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 直接算往往不可行（高维、分布未知），但跑一条长轨道取时间平均却容易。这是蒙特卡洛与 <a href=\"../../markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/monte-carlo-integration\">MCMC(26)</a> 的立身之本。</li>\n<li><strong>可预测性</strong>：知道平衡分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，就能预言任意单条长期轨迹的统计行为，无需解运动方程。这是统计力学的核心跳板。</li>\n<li><strong>遍历性是开关</strong>：等式成立与否完全由系统是否遍历决定。判断一个真实系统是否遍历，因此成了能否用「空间平均代替时间平均」的前提问题——而这往往极难验证。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"回应玻尔兹曼-买到了什么-没买到什么\">回应玻尔兹曼：买到了什么，没买到什么</h2><p>玻尔兹曼想用遍历假设论证「气体必然趋于热平衡、可用系综平均代替时间平均」。两大遍历定理给了他一半。</p>\n<p><strong>买到的</strong>：在测度论意义下，「时间平均 = 空间平均」是严格定理，只要系统遍历。这把玻尔兹曼的跳板从信仰变成数学。</p>\n<p><strong>没买到的</strong>有三处，恰是后续章节存在的理由：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>遍历性本身极难验证</strong>。证明一个具体的物理哈密顿系统遍历是出了名地难——Sinai 在 1963 年才对「硬球气体」这一理想模型部分证明，一般情形至今未解。等式成立的前提，本身就是块硬骨头。</li>\n<li><strong>遍历不等于趋于平衡</strong>。Birkhoff 只保证「长期平均」等于空间平均，不保证系统<strong>单调地、快速地</strong>走向平衡态。要刻画「搅匀的速度」，需要比遍历更强的<strong>混合性</strong>——这正是<a href=\"../mixing-entropy/mixing-systems\">混合系统</a>的主题。遍历的圆旋转永远不混合，奶永远搅不匀。</li>\n<li><strong>时间尺度问题</strong>。庞加莱回复（见<a href=\"../foundations/measure-preserving\">保测变换</a>）说系统终会回到初态，但回复时间可能长达宇宙年龄的天文倍数；遍历定理说收敛，却不给收敛速率。要量化「多快」与「多不可预测」，需要<a href=\"../mixing-entropy/kolmogorov-entropy\">测度熵</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"从-相等-到-多快-多乱\">从「相等」到「多快、多乱」</h2><p>这一篇标志着基础与定理部分的收尾：我们已经知道时间平均与空间平均在遍历系统里相等。但「相等」是定性的终点、也是定量问题的起点。奶会搅匀（遍历），可搅多快（混合）、过程产生多少不可预测性（熵）、用算子谱怎么读这一切（谱视角）——这三问正是下一章要回答的。等式合一是地基，强弱与复杂度的谱系才是上层建筑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>「时间平均 = 空间平均」在遍历系统里由 Birkhoff（逐点）与 von Neumann（均方）共同保证。</li>\n<li>非遍历时两者收敛到条件期望，即所在遍历分量内的空间平均。</li>\n<li>它买到了可计算性（蒙特卡洛）与可预测性（统计力学），遍历性是总开关。</li>\n<li>它没买到：遍历性本身难验证、遍历不等于趋衡、不给收敛速率。</li>\n<li>这些缺口分别由混合性、测度熵、谱视角在下一章补上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>逐点版本：<a href=\"birkhoff-theorem\">Birkhoff 遍历定理</a></li>\n<li>均方版本：<a href=\"von-neumann-mean\">von Neumann 平均遍历</a></li>\n<li>「搅多快」：<a href=\"../mixing-entropy/mixing-systems\">混合系统</a></li>\n<li>蒙特卡洛积分（MCMC 26）：<a href=\"../../markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/monte-carlo-integration\">蒙特卡洛积分</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时间与空间平均","id":"时间与空间平均"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一条等式，两种收敛","id":"核心概念-一条等式-两种收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"它到底买到了什么","id":"它到底买到了什么"},{"level":2,"text":"回应玻尔兹曼：买到了什么，没买到什么","id":"回应玻尔兹曼-买到了什么-没买到什么"},{"level":2,"text":"从「相等」到「多快、多乱」","id":"从-相等-到-多快-多乱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"von Neumann 平均遍历定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/ergodic-theory/theorems/von-neumann-mean"},"next":{"title":"混合系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/ergodic-theory/mixing-entropy/mixing-systems"}}